{"absolutePath":"/Users/dave/plebtech/sway-website/lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy.md","content":"---\nlat:\n  mode: how-to\n---\n\n# Run and deploy the site\n\nThe site is static HTML, CSS and one script. There is no build step, so what is in the repository is what is served.\n\n## Run the site locally\n\nServe the repository root so root-relative paths like `/assets/css/style.css` resolve.\n\n1. Open a terminal in the repository root.\n2. Run `python3 -m http.server 8000`, or `npx serve .`.\n3. Open `http://localhost:8000/`.\n4. Check the home page and one subpage such as `/html/tos.html`.\n\n## Deploy to Cloudflare Pages\n\nCloudflare Pages deploys straight from the repository root with no build command.\n\n1. Commit the change to a branch and push it.\n2. In the Cloudflare Pages project, leave the build command empty and set the output directory to `/`.\n3. Merge to `main`. Pages publishes the root, including `_redirects`.\n4. Open the live site and confirm `/html/choosing-the-bill-of-the-week.html` redirects to the month page.\n","path":"how-to/run-and-deploy.md","projectPath":"lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy.md","frontmatter":{"raw":{"mode":"how-to"}},"sections":[{"id":"lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy#Run and deploy the site","heading":"Run and deploy the site","depth":1,"file":"lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy","filePath":"lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy.md","children":[{"id":"lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy#Run and deploy the site#Run the site locally","heading":"Run the site locally","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy","filePath":"lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy.md","children":[],"startLine":10,"endLine":18,"firstParagraph":"Serve the repository root so root-relative paths like `/assets/css/style.css` resolve.","githubSlug":"run-the-site-locally"},{"id":"lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy#Run and deploy the site#Deploy to Cloudflare Pages","heading":"Deploy to Cloudflare Pages","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy","filePath":"lat.md/how-to/run-and-deploy.md","ch